//厨房扉前 h //e
resource PC_Ｃ脚厨房扉前__s {
//vox t:vc261161 {
大佐_000: {
Stillman estar&'a a salvo siempre y
cuando se quede all&'i. T&'u preoc&'upate
de desactivar esas C4.
}
//	<<<ENGLISH>>>
//	Stillman is safe as long as he's in
//	there. You worry about defusing
//	those C4's instead.

